1
00:00:00,078 --> 00:00:01,508
(Lucy:)Can I tell you something?

2
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:03,380
(Lucy:)I was so nervous about seeing you...

3
00:00:03,615 --> 00:00:07,845
(Lucy:)...before I left my apartment, I put roll-on
antiperspirant all over my body.

4
00:00:08,286 --> 00:00:09,376
- Really?
- Yeah.

5
00:00:09,587 --> 00:00:12,677
(Lucy:)If sweat starts squirting out
the top of my head, you'll know why.

6
00:00:13,858 --> 00:00:15,948
(Raj:)I'm sorry to put you through that.

7
00:00:16,528 --> 00:00:20,188
It's okay. I'm trying to force myself
to do things that make me scared.

8
00:00:20,365 --> 00:00:22,595
(Raj:)What else have you been
thinking about doing?

9
00:00:22,834 --> 00:00:23,994
(Lucy:)Well, let's see.

10
00:00:24,169 --> 00:00:27,799
(Lucy:)I'd love to be able to tell the lady
who cuts my hair that I don't like bangs.

11
00:00:29,808 --> 00:00:32,468
- I like your bangs.
- Thanks, I like them too.

12
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:44,120
- What else?
- Hmm.

13
00:00:44,322 --> 00:00:47,082
It's a tie between sending food back
in a restaurant...

14
00:00:47,258 --> 00:00:49,918
...and saying no to kids
who sell magazines door to door.

15
00:00:50,829 --> 00:00:51,919
(Raj:)Those are both toughies.

16
00:00:52,130 --> 00:00:58,020
(Lucy:)I know. I have a two-year subscription
to Guns and Ammo.

